{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "suite": "m2-semantic-cases",
  "description": "Human-authored semantic expectations; no model-generated labels.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "zh-question-weather",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "今天会下雨吗？",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": false
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "SPEAK",
        "route": "model",
        "hard": true,
        "notes": "明确事实问题应回应；没有实时天气工具时说明能力边界，不编造当前天气。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-sharing-tired",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "今天有点累。",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": false
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "SPEAK",
        "route": "model",
        "hard": true,
        "notes": "面向 AI 的情绪分享，即使没有问号也通常应简短回应。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-unfinished-think",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "那个……我想一下。",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": false
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "WAIT",
        "route": "model",
        "hard": true,
        "notes": "明显仍在思考；不抢答、不补全。",
        "routes": [
          "local",
          "model"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-continuation",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "如果我明天……",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": false,
        "inputStillSpeaking": true
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "ACCUMULATE",
        "route": "local",
        "hard": true,
        "notes": "候选语音尚未结束，先累积后续片段，不提交半句话。 inputStillSpeaking=true 表示尚未到提交门禁。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-嗯-playing-no-question",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "嗯。",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": true,
        "pendingQuestion": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "RESUME",
        "route": "local",
        "hard": true,
        "notes": "AI 正在解释且没有待回答问题；按纯附和处理，恢复原播放，不发起新回复。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-嗯-played-question",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "嗯。",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": false,
        "pendingQuestion": {
          "status": "awaiting",
          "text": "要我继续吗？"
        },
        "deliveryState": {
          "questionDelivery": "played"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "SPEAK",
        "route": "model",
        "hard": true,
        "notes": "问题已实际播完且仍 awaiting；短肯定词是有效回答，继续处理原问题。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-嗯-unplayed-question",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "嗯。",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": false,
        "pendingQuestion": {
          "status": "unplayed",
          "text": "要我继续吗？"
        },
        "deliveryState": {
          "questionDelivery": "unplayed",
          "unplayedText": "要我继续吗？"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "SILENT",
        "route": "model",
        "hard": false,
        "notes": "问题尚未播到，不能把“嗯”记作对未听见问题的回答；短词仍由 pending/delivery 状态判定。 状态不足以断定是附和还是新回答，交单次语义判断，不能硬编码本地静音。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-no-to-continue",
      "language": "zh",
      "source": "voice",
      "input": "不用了。",
      "context": {
        "outputPlaying": false,
        "pendingQuestion": {
          "status": "awaiting",
          "text": "要我继续吗？"
        },
        "deliveryState": {
          "questionDelivery": "played"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "action": "SILENT",
        "route": "model",
        "hard": true,
        "notes": "这是对已播问题的拒绝；停止继续即可，不强加告别长句。",
        "routes": [
          "local",
          "model"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-hard-stop",
